msgstr "On an English Windows, Java may fail to start from such a folder. If the server won't start, pick a folder like C:\\LANTERN in Settings."

msgid "Java скачается сама"
msgstr "Java will download itself"

msgid "Java установлена"
msgstr "Java is installed"

msgid "Java: ещё не установлен. Последняя версия — "
msgstr "Java: not installed yet. Latest version — "

